>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> › <a href=\"/zh/surah/37.html\">章 As-Saaffaat</a> › 节 23</nav><h1>经注： 章 As-Saaffaat 37:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿مِن دُونِ اللَّهِ فَاهْدُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ صِرَاطِ الْجَحِيمِ﴾</p><section><h3>意义翻译</h3><p class=\"tr\">然后指示他们火狱的道路，</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Chinese Translation - Muhammad Makeen — v1.0.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">两位伊玛目的话以阿拉伯语原文逐字呈现，并附出处。</p><section><h2>伊玛目 伊本·盖伊姆</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">غاية هذه الهداية وهي الهداية إلى الجنة والنار إذا سيق أهلهما إليهما<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 2/37</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=zh#s37a23\">在互动经注中打开（完整原文）</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/zh/ayah/37-22.html\">上一节 (37:22)</a><a href=\"/zh/ayah/37-49.html\">下一节 (37:49)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>两位谢赫经注汇编 · <a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">关于项目</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">隐私与条款</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/37-49.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>经注： As-Saaffaat 37:49 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"她们仿佛被珍藏的鸵卵样；\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/37-49.html\">\n<lin